It is evening.
I am in my new flat.
I am very hungry.
I want dinner.
I go to the kitchen.
I open the cupboard.
The shelves are completely empty.
I see only a plate and a glass.
There is no food here.
I open the fridge too.
The fridge is also completely empty.
I want rice and dal.
I like Indian food.
I want vegetables and spices for dinner.
I need groceries immediately.
I close the empty cupboard.
But first I need a list.
I go to my desk.
